core: Ultra Light Core (1:2 blend of Poplar and Paulownia for excellent strength to weight ratio)
sidewalls: Flex Walls (urethane sidewalls instead of ABS, bonds more effectively to core for more durable and damp construction)
base: Ultra Glide S (premium 7000-grade sintered, ultra-dense P-tex construction for elite performance)
shipping restriction: Only available for shipping within Australia
